{
  "id": "poem-7d2e6ab3b6bcc3e22d426bb7",
  "title": "前腔",
  "author": "高明《蔡伯喈琵琶记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "你夺将去，真可怜，公婆望奴奴不见。",
    "纵然他不埋怨，道我做媳妇还何干？他忍饥，添我夫罪愆。",
    "怎得见，我夫面？。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-5044",
